; Items collected, as three ASCII digits
;
; Shown on the status line ("Items collected 000"; printed by #R$89AD at
; screen address $5070). #R$87CA sets it to "000" at the start of a game and
; #R$93D1 adds 1 for every item collected, with decimal carry from the last
; digit to the first.
; .
; Observed: "000" becomes "001" at the first pick-up; "099" becomes "100".
@label=ItemsCollectedText
t$857C DEFM "000"
